|leveling2     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|100 to 300}} {{as|(+ 90% AP)}}}}
|description3 = While the target is {{tip|stun|stunned}}, '''Thresh''' tugs his hook towards him twice, once after a {{tt|{{fd|0.1}}-second delay|Estimated}} and again {{tt|{{fd|0.6}} seconds|Estimated, starting from the end of the initial delay}} after that. With each tug, the target is pulled a short distance towards '''Thresh'''. After {{fd|0.5}} seconds of hitting an enemy, or instantly after hitting a {{tip|minion}} or {{tip|monster}}, '''Thresh''' can recast the ability while the target is ''Shackled''.
|icon4        = Deathly Leap.png
|description4 = {{sbc|Recast - Deathly Leap:}} '''Thresh''' stops tugging his hook and {{tip|dashes}} to the ''Shackled'' enemy, becoming able to attack again upon arrival. He can cast ''{{ai|Dark Passage|Thresh}}'' and ''{{ai|Flay|Thresh}}'' during the dash.
